### Campaign 4: Life Jackets Donation (Goods)
POST {{baseUrl}}/create-campaign
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Safety Gear for Small Boat Owners",
  "description": "Collecting certified life jackets for low-income traditional fishermen.",
  "category": "Livelihood Support",
  "campaignType": "GOODS",
  "startDate": "2026-04-10T00:00:00.000Z",
  "endDate": "2026-05-30T00:00:00.000Z",
  "address": {
    "city": "Shrivardhan",
    "state": "Maharashtra",
    "country": "India",
    "landmark": "Fishing Harbor"
  },
  "goods": {
    "itemRequired": "Life Jackets (Adult Size)",
    "quantity": 150
  }
}

